  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short present stems of four to six words with a clear set-2 action. Distractors are the base verb, a far -ed guess, and a far participle. Add a noun picture lemma.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems of five to eight words. Mix <NAME>. Use closer -ed forms and true participles that look almost right.",
    "3": "Near-miss participles kids mix with simple past, such as gave/given, began/begun, took/taken, or hid/hidden. Stems of seven to ten words. Never two choices that both fit."
  },
